{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你是否曾經為了打發零碎時間而下載了十幾款遊戲，卻發現每一款都玩不久？《Word &amp; Logic》將所有最受歡迎的文字遊戲與邏輯謎題濃縮在一個 App 中，無論是等車、排隊還是午休的五分鐘，都能立刻切換到不同的腦力挑戰。今天這款應用正限時免費中，原價 US $3.99，錯過就得等下次了。</p>\n\n<h2>從填字到數獨一應俱全</h2>\n<p>內建尋字遊戲、填字遊戲、數獨、密碼破解、單詞猜測等超過十種玩法，還有「魔幻六邊形」這類考驗數學邏輯的獨特關卡。每個遊戲都設計了直覺的拖曳或滑動手勢，並支援超過 15 種語言，讓你不只訓練母語詞彙，還能順便練習外語。關卡總數超過 10,000 關，加上每日挑戰與深色模式，無論白天黑夜都能享受舒適的解謎體驗。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-24-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-27-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-28-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-29-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Word &amp; Logic: 迷你益智遊戲</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T23:02:04.965386+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}